---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const title = 'How It Works | Proof to Partner';
const description = 'See how Proof to Partner defines requirements, researches relevant counterparties and explores introductions only when fit and permission are clear.';
const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'How it works', path: '/how-it-works/' }];
const steps = [
{ n: '01', title: 'Understand the requirement', detail: 'We begin with a conversation about the actual need: scope, location, timing, budget or commercial constraints where relevant, and the criteria that would make a counterpart suitable.', output: 'A clearer brief and open questions' },
{ n: '02', title: 'Research the context', detail: 'Where a useful path exists, we may research businesses and relevant public information, check fit against the brief, and distinguish verifiable facts from assumptions that still need confirmation.', output: 'A reasoned view of potential fit' },
{ n: '03', title: 'Qualify interest and suitability', detail: 'A name in a directory is not enough. The next step is to assess capability and relevance and, where possible, establish whether each party is open to a conversation.', output: 'A considered introduction opportunity' },
{ n: '04', title: 'Agree the next step', detail: 'If the fit appears credible and the parties agree, an introduction can be explored. Any commercial arrangement or referral fee must be discussed and agreed before proceeding.', output: 'A consent-based next step—or a clear stop' },
];
---
<SiteLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/how-it-works/" breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
<section class="bg-ink py-16 text-white sm:py-24"><div class="container-shell max-w-5xl"><p class="eyebrow !text-[#a4d4c7]">The process</p><h1 class="display-heading mt-6 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold sm:text-6xl">A considered route from requirement to relevant conversation.</h1><p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/70">Good introductions are not just about finding names. They depend on understanding the need, checking context and being clear about what is—and is not—known.</p></div></section>
<section class="section-space"><div class="container-shell grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[.56fr_1.44fr] lg:gap-16"><div><p class="eyebrow">Four practical stages</p><p class="prose-copy mt-5">The process is intentionally flexible. The amount of research and qualification depends on the nature and clarity of the requirement.</p></div><div class="space-y-4">{steps.map((step) => <article class="card-border grid gap-5 p-6 sm:grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] sm:p-8"><div class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-mint text-sm font-bold tracking-wider text-brand-deep">{step.n}</div><div><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">{step.title}</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">{step.detail}</p><p class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-paper px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-ink-soft"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand"></span>{step.output}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="border-y border-line bg-white py-16"><div class="container-shell grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2"><div><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What this process can do</h2><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted"><li>• Clarify the commercial requirement and criteria for a useful match.</li><li>• Organise research around the need instead of producing a generic contact list.</li><li>• Help parties determine whether an introduction is worth exploring.</li></ul></div><div><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What it cannot promise</h2><ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted"><li>• A guaranteed supplier, buyer, contract, transaction or outcome.</li><li>• That public information is complete, current or independently verified in every detail.</li><li>• That another business is available, interested, compliant or financially suitable without further checks.</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="container-shell py-16 sm:py-20"><div class="rounded-3xl bg-mint p-7 sm:p-10"><p class="eyebrow">Frequently asked</p><h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">A few useful things to know.</h2><div class="mt-8 grid gap-7 md:grid-cols-2"><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Do all enquiries lead to an introduction?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">No. Some requirements may be too early, unclear or outside a practical match. A useful outcome can also be learning that a connection is not appropriate.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Will my details be shared automatically?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">No. Do not include confidential information in the form. Any sharing with a potential counterparty should be discussed with you first.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">Is the service limited to one industry?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">The business is intended to be cross-industry. Whether a category fits depends on the brief and available research.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold">What does an introduction cost?</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Any fee or commercial arrangement depends on the specific work and must be discussed and agreed before an introduction proceeds. Submitting this form does not commit you to a fee.</p></div></div><a class="btn-primary mt-8" href="/contact/">Discuss your requirement <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>